MFEM mesh v1.0

# The unit cube cut into six pyramids that share its centre as apex: each pyramid
# base is one face of the cube. Every interior face is a triangle shared by two
# pyramids, so Nedelec spaces of order 2 and above need the DoF transformation of
# the triangular faces (https://github.com/awslabs/palace/issues/1204). Volume and
# boundary attribute 1.

